    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d832">

                <pb facs="0779" n="663" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg663"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.20/3.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-01-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 13, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s January 10. Liberian President submitted Department’s proposition to
                    Legislature and obtained its approval as to <pb facs="0780" n="664"
                        xml:id="pg664"/> number of ex-noncommissioned officers for border police and
                    amount of their respective salaries with housing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Crum</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
